{"study_accession":"PRJNA975200","secondary_study_accession":"SRP439007","title":"Single Cell RNA sequencing of the Monocytes from controls and pulmonary arterial hypertension (PAH) patients","description":"We report the application of single cell RNA sequencing on human Peripheral Blood Mononuclear cells. The 12 samples are sequenced as biological replications (6 control and 6 patients), and pooled at the analysis stage. The library was prepared using the Chromium Single Cell 3' v2 and v3 Reagent Kit, and sample processing was under bcl2fastq2/2.20.0 and cellranger/2.2.0. We report a decreased CD14 in classical monocytes among PAH patients, with greater potential of apoptosis for CD14+ monocytes population. This study provide a reference for studying the monocytes related abonormalties in PAH and other inflammatory diseases. Overall design: Six control samples and six patient samples are barcoded for sequencing in the same flowcell on Illumina HiSeq-4000 platform. For each sample, 5000 alive cells are used as input.","pubmed":"","geo_series":"","n_samples":12,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN35319599","study_accession":"PRJNA975200","blood_class":"pbmc","class_from":"sample","title":"RH4-04","description":"RH4-04","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM7412352","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2023-06-22","attributes":[["source_name","blood"],["tissue","blood"],["cell_type","PBMC"],["genotype","Control"],["geo_loc_name","missing"],["collection_date","missing"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR24688956","experiment_accession":"SRX20468125","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"Illumina HiSeq 4000","read_count":364956447,"base_count":73721202294,"first_public":"2023-06-22","experiment_title":"Illumina HiSeq 4000 sequencing: GSM7412352: RH4-04 Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"}],"labels":[]},{"sample_accession":"SAMN35319600","study_accession":"PRJNA975200","blood_class":"pbmc","class_from":"sample","title":"RH4-03","description":"RH4-03